From cfd08caba52fffa4ea7b21aa879b05033dd2e859 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (Cowork)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 12:30:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase B: admin CRUD + editors for events, jobs, pages,
 categories

- Events/Jobs/Pages: list + 3-language editor (draft/publish, in-editor cover/hero + insert-image upload); new AdminXController/AdminXService/DTOs
- Categories: inline-edit page (key, sort order, name per language) with a delete guard when posts still reference the category
- Translation upsert reconciles in place (avoids the (x_id, lang) unique-constraint clash, same fix as posts)
- Frontend: new admin screens + routes + sidebar nav; adminApi methods
- PostRepository.countByCategoryKey for the category delete guard

All endpoints live under /api/admin/** (ADMIN or EDITOR, already secured). Frontend production build verified.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
